    <p>On 17 February 2026 Nvidia said millions of Blackwell and Rubin chips, and GB300-based systems.</p>
    <p>GB300 NVL72 is 72 Blackwell Ultra GPUs and 36 Grace CPUs, at 1.5x the AI performance of GB200 NVL72. Rack memory is 37 TB of fast memory. GPU memory is 20 TB at up to 576 TB/s. NVLink is 130 TB/s.</p>
    <p>The Rubin GPU is 50 petaflops of NVFP4 inference, with 288 GB of HBM4 at 19.2 TB/s. It is in production. Partner products are in the second half of 2026. Vera Rubin NVL72 is 72 Rubin GPUs and 36 Vera CPUs.</p>

